{
    "title": "Apple tv Remote",
    "description": "Apple TV Remote is a remote control app for your TV. It's the perfect solution for controlling your Apple TV from your phone device.\r\n\r\nDownload it now and enjoy the convenience of a wireless remote controller.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n\r\n- Works with Android phones and tablets\r\n- Touchpad for content navigation\r\n- Adjust volume\r\n- Play, pause, and control your favorite shows and movies\r\n- No additional hardware needed.\r\n- Automatic connection to a device\r\n- Playback control\r\n- Quick access to all apps\r\n\r\nNo configuration required:\r\nSimply connect and control.\r\n\r\nEasy to use:\r\nWe designed the app to be intuitive and so anyone can use it without the need for training. It's simpler than using a physical remote.\r\n\r\nAdjust volume:\r\nApple Tv Remote is a complete and superior alternative to your physical remote. It can perform all the functions of your physical remote, including adjusting the TV volume.\r\n\r\nCompatible Devices:\r\n\r\n\r\nThe following Apple TV models are supported by our app:\r\n\r\n\r\n- Television (1st, 2nd and 3rd generation)\r\n- HD TV (4th generation)\r\n- 4K TV (1st, 2nd, 3rd and 5th generation)\r\n- TV (4th generation ) generation), using tvOS 9.2.1 or later;\r\n- TV (3rd generation), using Apple TV 7.2.1 software.\r\n\r\nHow to connect to TV:\r\n\r\n1. Your TV must be connected to your home wifi network.\r\n2. Your Android phone's WiFi must be turned on and connected to the same network as the TV.\r\n3. Launch this app and tap to select the target device to connect. Once connected, you will be able to control your devices however you want.\r\n\r\nTroubleshoot:\r\n- This app can only connect if you are on the same wifi network as your TV.\r\n- If not connected to the TV, reinstalling this app and restarting the TV can fix most bugs.\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nWe are not associated with Apple and this app is not an official Apple product.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Apple TV Remote is a remote control app for your TV. It&#39;s the perfect solution for controlling your Apple TV from your phone device.<br><br>Download it now and enjoy the convenience of a wireless remote controller.<br><br>Features:<br><br><br>- Works with Android phones and tablets<br>- Touchpad for content navigation<br>- Adjust volume<br>- Play, pause, and control your favorite shows and movies<br>- No additional hardware needed.<br>- Automatic connection to a device<br>- Playback control<br>- Quick access to all apps<br><br>No configuration required:<br>Simply connect and control.<br><br>Easy to use:<br>We designed the app to be intuitive and so anyone can use it without the need for training. It&#39;s simpler than using a physical remote.<br><br>Adjust volume:<br>Apple Tv Remote is a complete and superior alternative to your physical remote. It can perform all the functions of your physical remote, including adjusting the TV volume.<br><br>Compatible Devices:<br><br><br>The following Apple TV models are supported by our app:<br><br><br>- Television (1st, 2nd and 3rd generation)<br>- HD TV (4th generation)<br>- 4K TV (1st, 2nd, 3rd and 5th generation)<br>- TV (4th generation ) generation), using tvOS 9.2.1 or later;<br>- TV (3rd generation), using Apple TV 7.2.1 software.<br><br>How to connect to TV:<br><br>1. Your TV must be connected to your home wifi network.<br>2. Your Android phone&#39;s WiFi must be turned on and connected to the same network as the TV.<br>3. Launch this app and tap to select the target device to connect. Once connected, you will be able to control your devices however you want.<br><br>Troubleshoot:<br>- This app can only connect if you are on the same wifi network as your TV.<br>- If not connected to the TV, reinstalling this app and restarting the TV can fix most bugs.<br>Disclaimer:<br>We are not associated with Apple and this app is not an official Apple product.",
